## Success Criteria

- [ ] Integration test passes end-to-end
- [ ] Provider swap test passes for claude/gemini/openai
- [ ] Backtest accuracy >= 75% on 50+ historical cases
- [ ] LLM dependency < 20% of verdicts (NEEDS_LLM rate)
- [ ] Hallucination filter rejects > 10% of raw claims (proving it catches real issues)
- [ ] Health check script runs in < 5s
- [ ] All calibration thresholds in single JSON config
- [ ] Evolution cycle test proves system learns (query → gap → fill → resolve locally)

## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Not enough historical cases for backtest | Use synthetic cases + existing outcomes.db |
| Backtest accuracy < 75% | Calibrate thresholds iteratively. If < 60%, redesign feature schema |
| Health check script becomes maintenance burden | Keep it simple: read SQLite + JSON, compute stats, print |
